---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Distribution of Blankets — GWE NGO INDIA"
  description="GWE NGO India distributes blankets to elderly women living on the streets so they can sleep warm on cold nights."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Distribution of Blankets</h1>
        <p>A warm night's sleep for elders who have to live on the streets.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container prose">
        <img class="page-image" src="/images/community-photo.jpg" alt="Blanket distribution to elders by GWE NGO India" loading="lazy" />
        <p>
          Life becomes tougher as we grow old, the human cycle has been built that way, people start
          having joint pains, and it becomes tougher for them to bear cold weathers as they grow in
          age, and why elders, even youngsters can't bear cold. The thought that elderly women have
          to sleep on streets on a cold night brigs chills to our team.
        </p>
        <p>
          On researching, GWE NGO India found that there are hundreds of women who have to live on
          streets no matter what. Therefore, we decided to help them get a better life by doing
          whatever we can, starting with providing them blankets to help them sleep on a cold night.
        </p>
        <p>
          You too can be a part of this initiative by providing them with blankets so that they can
          live a warm life.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/donate">Donate Blankets</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
